(7689497, 1259971, 67145, '<td valign="top">LOVE LOVE LOVE this .. !!!! ... <br/>its so beautiful .. the tones are perfect .. <br/>so excellent .. i''m pretty blown away you may tell ..!!.. <br/>loving how you have the branch coming out from behind the frame . that''s a stroke of genius ..<br/>i''m not voting yet .. :)</td>', 'LOVE LOVE LOVE this .. !!!! ... its so beautiful .. the tones are perfect .. so excellent .. i''m pretty blown away you may tell ..!!.. loving how you have the branch coming out from behind the frame . that''s a stroke of genius ..i''m not voting yet .. :)', '2021-03-15 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689505, 1259752, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wow, how can this bee be so incredibly clean? I had a similar (sort of ;-)) picture of a bee pollinating a flower and it was covered in pollen everywhere. This picture is so clean and has a nice sharpness as well as softness.  I love the warm light from the top right.</td>', 'Wow, how can this bee be so incredibly clean? I had a similar (sort of ;-)) picture of a bee pollinating a flower and it was covered in pollen everywhere. This picture is so clean and has a nice sharpness as well as softness.  I love the warm light from the top right.', '2021-03-15 05:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689561, 1259942, 181505, '<td valign="top">I really love the bird and how you put the faded flowers in this! Just gorgeous! However the left area is so bright it distracts me from the lovely softness of the right side. One of my top picks in this challenge.</td>', 'I really love the bird and how you put the faded flowers in this! Just gorgeous! However the left area is so bright it distracts me from the lovely softness of the right side. One of my top picks in this challenge.', '2021-03-16 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689631, 1259944, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and the red looks nice and clean, but the glass itself is not photographed in a beautiful and clean way. I see a lot of refraction/reflection of the surroundings in it. The foot seems dirty and part if it is blown out.</td>', 'Nice idea and the red looks nice and clean, but the glass itself is not photographed in a beautiful and clean way. I see a lot of refraction/reflection of the surroundings in it. The foot seems dirty and part if it is blown out.', '2021-03-17 08:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
